OL,3,GNEWSAGun licensing a 'postcode
OL,4,Alottery', report says
OL,5,
OL,6,FProblems with England and Wales'
OL,7,Ffirearms licensing system are putting
OL,8,F"public safety at risk", a report has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FHis Majesty's Inspectorate of
OL,12,FConstabulary and Fire & Rescue Services
OL,13,F(HMICFRS) said the process was not fit
OL,14,Ffor purpose with applicants facing a
OL,15,F"postcode lottery" in how they were
OL,16,Fassessed.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
