OL,3,GNEWSAGun licensing a 'postcode
OL,4,Alottery', report says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report was carried out following
OL,7,Fthe murder of five people in the Keyham
OL,8,Farea of Plymouth in 2021 by Jake
OL,9,FDavison, who also took his own life,
OL,10,Fweeks after having his shotgun
OL,11,Fcertificate returned to him after it
OL,12,Fhad been seized when he assaulted a
OL,13,Fteenage boy.
OL,15,FThe inspectorate blamed "unclear
OL,16,Fguidance and legislation" combined with
OL,17,F"poor supervision and oversight" for
OL,18,Fthe shortfalls.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
